{"id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-standard-model.md","title":"Standard Model","display":"df-standard-model — Standard Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-standard-model","aliases":["92-df-standard-model"],"display":"df-standard-model — Standard Model","depends_on":["[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"],"source":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开","source_status":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-standard-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-standard-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-standard-model — Standard Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-standard-model-—-Standard-Model-$\\mathbb{N}$\">df-standard-model — Standard Model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (definition-target standard structure)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathfrak N_G\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\mathbb N,(0,n\\mapsto n+1,+,\\cdot,\\{(n,n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\})\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathfrak N_G\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\mathbb N,(0,n\\mapsto n+1,+,\\cdot,\\{(n,n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\})\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> : 自然数的标准模型</li>\n<li>标准模型是真算术的模型</li>\n<li>在标准模型中：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n(0) = n\">\\(S^n(0) = n\\)</span></li>\n<li>对一致、递归可公理化且足够强的算术理论，按其标准可证性谓词构造的 Gödel 句在标准模型中为真而在该理论中不可证；这不是任意所谓“Gödel句子”的无条件性质</li>\n<li>PA 若一致，则由紧致性定理存在非标准模型</li>\n<li>可靠性 = 只证明在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中真的句子</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-standard-model-—-Standard-Model-$\\mathbb{N}$","text":"df-standard-model — Standard Model $\\mathbb{N}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":